  "notes": "6 transactions, each with a before_all_txs fee event and an after_all_txs refund. Two carry a custom exposure_synced event: apply index 0 (the focus, from CBSWA5P7\u2026, topic HYPE) and apply index 2 (from CBMLLYBH\u2026, topic PAXG). In the focus GCDGUVMC\u2026 calls sync_asset_pnl(HYPE) on CBHHWFAY\u2026, which updates one of its own entries and two of CBSWA5P7\u2026; the fee events charge 26925 and refund -9741 (fee_charged 17184). The custom event names no account and moves no value. Written live by stellar-core 28.0.1. Testnet is reset on 2026-12-16; the vendored object will then be the only copy."
